[04:16] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'side, Colemap 4.2 2 released which added loma support and also some really nice additions for people doing processing using 360 cameras with co map. Speaking of 360 capture and processing, one of the other Dell Pro ambassadors, Manual Vision, also just put out a pipeline'

