VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'good. So, I\'d be super curious to see how it looks now with 4D anyone turbo. I also forgot to mention that the inference speed also went up six times. So, it\'s going to get significantly faster, too. So, pretty crazy. 2 weeks end to end. We\'re living in really wild'

