[08:29] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'because we typically associate 3D reconstruction with freezing important or really happy moments in time. But in the same way that photography helped illustrate the horrors of things like the Great Depression and uh different wars throughout history, I think that'

